WEBVTT

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.410
<i>Is Ruki-san working overnight?</i>

00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:22.500
<i>She's amazing for having a serialized 
manga while going to school.</i>

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.090
I ran out of donuts!

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:25.820
I see.

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:28.710
I wonder if they're going 
to come out with new flavors.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:31.520
<i>That sexiness...</i>

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:34.480
<i>It's no wonder she's a 
teens' love manga artist.</i>

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:38.670
She must be thinking lewd 
things even when she goes to school

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:40.160
so she's always in the mood!

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:43.030
I'm just tired because I have 
a deadline coming up!

00:00:57.030 --> 00:01:03.330
Comic Girls

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:21.900
Huh?

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:23.860
You stayed up all night 
two nights in a row?!

00:02:24.530 --> 00:02:26.660
I had a lot of pages this month,

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:28.100
not to mention color pages, too...

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:31.330
<i>I guess you would be sleepy 
if you had to stay up for two nights...</i>

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:34.560
Irokawa, translate this sentence.

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:36.040
Yes, ma'am.

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:41.720
Can I...

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:46.350
go to your house tonight? {orig: go to your place tonight?} {M: I think the board says "home" but that sounds weird <<;}{Z: While it sounds weird I don't want to be yelled at and since the English is there... XD}

00:02:47.190 --> 00:02:48.930
Hey! Read it normally!

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:53.160
Ruki-san's destructive power 
before a deadline is intense!

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:50.360
Huh?!

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:09.500
Ruki-san, I think you should head 
home and sleep a little.

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:11.930
No, I shouldn't skip...

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:15.670
<i>I have to keep up with both...</i>

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:17.910
<i>Otherwise, I can't call myself a pro...</i>

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:23.320
Irokawa! Quit being so lewd!

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:24.980
I'm not trying to be...

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:25.800
<i>Ruki-san...</i>

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:29.060
<i>The more she tries to lead 
an earnest life, the more she's...</i>

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:32.020
Want to go to the nurse's office?

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:34.110
I'm fine.

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:37.730
If this was all I could take, 
I'd lose my readers.

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:41.990
I'm already drawing manga 
that's not suited for me, after all.

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:43.920
Not suited for it?

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:46.210
It's basically your calling in life!

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:51.660
Irokawa-san? You look rather tired.

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:55.050
Oh, I ended up staying up all night...

00:03:55.050 --> 00:03:57.710
Oh, for your history quiz?

00:03:57.710 --> 00:03:58.930
Um, actually...

00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:00.150
How commendable!

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:02.740
But staying up all night is bad for your 
health, so don't push yourself too hard.

00:04:02.740 --> 00:04:03.780
Yes, ma'am...

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:10.660
Ruki-chan, go ahead and take a nap.

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:13.290
We still have about 20 minutes 
on our lunch break.

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:14.440
Yeah.

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:18.780
Rukki can't sleep without 
her favorite plushy.

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:20.220
Hey, don't mention that!

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:21.400
So cute!

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:25.280
I guess you can't just 
bring plushies to school.

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:29.100
Here. Just hold Kaos instead.

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:30.320
They're basically the same thing.

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:32.740
Hey! No I'm not, Tsubasa-san!

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:40.800
<i>She fell asleep.</i>

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.250
She must be really tired.

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:53.680
Ruki-chan! We'll help 
you with your manuscript!

00:04:53.090 --> 00:04:54.150
No!

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:55.140
It's embarrassing!

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:59.250
If you guys saw how perverted 
this is, I'd just die!

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:01.130
She's actually embarrassed...

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:05.320
Rukki, your perverted fantasies are already 
being sold in bookstores across the country.

00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:06.000
No!

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:05.990
Just give it up.

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:08.450
I'm going to go buy them all!

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:10.210
Work on your manuscript!

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:15.620
Rukki won't even let me 
touch her manuscripts.

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:16.980
It's that bad?

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:19.950
Then wouldn't it be better if you drew 
them at home rather than at the dor—

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:21.890
It'd be even worse if my family saw this!

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:24.520
If they found out about this, 
they'd disown me!

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:27.140
My grandma might die from shock!

00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:31.380
All I get out of it is a thrilling feeling,
like I'm building a bomb at home...

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:35.890
It must be hard drawing pervy manga.

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:38.700
Ruki-chan, you're all woozy. We 
can't leave you alone like that!

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:39.810
Please let us help!

00:05:40.350 --> 00:05:41.810
Girls...

00:05:42.310 --> 00:05:44.520
You won't tease me, 
even though it's pervy?

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:45.940
We won't!

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:46.780
In that case...

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:51.520
Hey! This is just the kiss scene!

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:53.050
You're not handling this well at all!

00:05:53.050 --> 00:05:55.490
<i>The dialogue is already pretty intense...</i>

00:05:55.490 --> 00:05:59.080
Then could you apply screentone on these 
pages that don't have any dialogue?

00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:00.960
Those drawings!

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:04.340
Would you stop reacting 
to every little thing?!

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:06.660
Jeez, you're making 
me even more embarrassed!

00:06:07.020 --> 00:06:08.300
Just give me your manuscript!

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:10.880
I'll apply screentones 
to that **** right there!

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:12.760
Tsu-chan, you should actually 
feel a little more embarrassed!

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:17.280
I'm sorry that we're so useless...

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:19.120
Sorry, Ruki-chan...

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:21.330
I'm the one who should be sorry.

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:24.730
I'll give Tsu-chan the more perverted pages.

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:26.870
This protagonist...

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:28.450
sort of resembles Koyume.

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:32.870
Oh. I always ask her to pose for me, 
so she started looking like her.

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:33.830
Huh...

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:36.100
Don't look!

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:38.340
Koyume-chan, you can't get in the way!

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:39.830
Yeah, I can't get any work don—

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:41.680
I'll do this page!

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:44.350
Then, I'll work on the page where 
Koyume gets knocked down...

00:06:44.350 --> 00:06:45.720
I'll work on that one, too!

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:47.620
And it's not me to begin with!

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:50.430
*We will be adding mosaics to the bits we can't show you.

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:52.330
Everything that's going on...

00:06:52.330 --> 00:06:54.050
I-I'm sorry, Koyume-chan.

00:06:58.280 --> 00:06:59.980
But

00:06:58.280 --> 00:06:59.980
I think she deserves 
you more than I do.

00:06:58.280 --> 00:06:59.980
I'm going to have
to punish you

00:06:58.280 --> 00:06:59.980
for saying such
naughty things.

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:06.580
Ruki-chan, this manga is pervy, 
but it's a really nice love story!

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:07.820
You get it, Koyume-chan?

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:10.980
It must be nice, 
understanding each other.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:15.520
<i>It looks like Koyume-chan's 
getting the hang of it.</i>

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:16.770
<i>As for Kaos-chan...</i>

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:20.150
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:07:20.150 --> 00:07:21.370
<i>She's peeking at the page
through her fingers!</i>

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:22.660
<i>I'm so sorry, Kaos-chan!</i>

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:24.350
<i>What am I making 
innocent Kaos-chan do?!</i>

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:26.470
<i>I'm such an idiot!</i>

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:29.340
Kaos-chan! Don't ink that page!

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:33.060
Just color this cute little bunny instead!

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:34.210
What for?!

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:36.430
This
is...

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:36.430
Tilt

00:07:34.210 --> 00:07:36.190
You're not allowed 
to look at this, Kaos-chan!

00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:38.800
What?! But I at least want to try!

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:38.810
The lace is
digging in

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:38.810
Ba-dump

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:38.810
Aah!

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:42.420
I want to see every detail of your 
manuscript because I admire you, Ruki-san!

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:44.420
No! It's too embarrassing!

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:48.400
<i>Tsu-chan is angry...</i>

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:50.880
Rukki! Concentrate on your manuscript!

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:54.900
Kaos just said she admires you, 
so have some faith in her!

00:07:54.900 --> 00:07:56.000
Tsu-chan...

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:57.200
Tsubasa-san...

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:58.570
You can do anything, right?

00:07:58.570 --> 00:07:59.240
Yes!

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:00.660
Then take care of this, please.

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:04.040
Kaos-chan!

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:05.920
Or not.

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:07.870
I'm fine...

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:11.940
Kaos, how many pages have you finished?

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:14.560
I-I haven't finished a single one yet...

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:16.450
Don't worry about it, Kaos-chan.

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:18.800
You just go at your own pace.

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:21.180
<i>They're spoiling me...</i>

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:22.970
Ruki-chan, I'm done with this one, too.

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:26.900
I'm a manga artist and I can't 
even do assistant work...

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:30.980
What is my purpose in life?

00:08:30.980 --> 00:08:33.810
<i>There she goes, 
bringing herself down again...</i>

00:08:33.970 --> 00:08:37.200
If only I could've done this in digital...

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:41.260
No, I'd be useless in any form.

00:08:41.260 --> 00:08:43.520
I'm more useless than a scourer...

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:47.620
Ruki-san, you bought a computer?

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:49.300
Oh, yeah.

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:52.540
I thought I'd try coloring digitally, too.

00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:53.720
Ooh.

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.400
Digitaruki-san!

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:57.970
But why aren't you using it?

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:59.060
Well...

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:05.160
It won't turn on.

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:06.850
That's the monitor....

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:08.530
Rukki doesn't do well with electronics.

00:09:08.530 --> 00:09:10.370
Wait, is it defective?!

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:13.860
Ruki-san... was anything else delivered with it?

00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:15.730
Come to think of it...

00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:17.710
there was some strange 
box that came with it.

00:09:17.710 --> 00:09:18.740
That's it!

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:21.930
Oh, so it's a computer chair!

00:09:21.930 --> 00:09:24.080
I feel digital just sitting on it.

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.420
That's the actual computer!

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:27.830
I'm so sorry!

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:30.620
<i>I can't believe she's 
so out of touch about this...</i>

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:34.410
Um... Want me to set up 
your computer for you?

00:09:34.410 --> 00:09:35.840
You can do that, Kaos-chan?!

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:36.830
Probably...

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:37.970
Then, please do!

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:44.080
Wow! You're typing 
without looking at the keys!

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:46.180
Kaos-chan, are you a professional PC-ist?!

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:47.770
PC-ist?

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:51.650
Please teach me the ways 
of the computer, Kaos-sensei!

00:09:51.910 --> 00:09:54.660
<i>I'm... Ruki-san's sensei?</i>

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:57.250
<i>She's always teaching me things,</i>

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:57.120
I'm going to punish you, Ruki-kun.

00:09:57.120 --> 00:09:58.830
You can't, Sensei.

00:09:57.250 --> 00:10:00.110
<i>but I guess I'm going to be 
teaching her about computer stuff!</i>

00:10:00.110 --> 00:10:02.010
Let's install some software!

00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:04.190
Ink... tone?

00:10:04.190 --> 00:10:06.080
<i>It's like watching a grandma 
and her granddaughter...</i>

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:12.130
Now you can draw.

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:12.930
Thanks!

00:10:14.010 --> 00:10:16.470
I'll try drawing the heroine 
from my next manga!

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:19.410
I did it!

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:22.610
She's so jagged!

00:10:22.610 --> 00:10:24.490
I see...

00:10:24.490 --> 00:10:26.950
Everything's so sharp 
when you draw digitally.

00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:28.560
This is obviously a failure!

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:36.430
Oh, no! I went outside the lines!

00:10:36.430 --> 00:10:37.950
What are you doing?!

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:39.570
I'll color it for you.

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:40.570
Just watch.

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:44.500
This is your basic coloring.

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:46.910
Now, I'll add in the effects.

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:47.960
Effects?

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:49.500
Wow!

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:51.430
The drawing instantly got sparkly!

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:53.490
You're like a wizard, Kaos-chan!

00:10:53.490 --> 00:10:54.850
You're amazing!

00:10:54.850 --> 00:10:56.210
It's nothing, really.

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:57.370
So...

00:10:58.300 --> 00:10:59.380
How's that manuscript coming?

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:08.980
Episode 4:
"Scuffling Wildly
Rendezvous"

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:08.980
Let's enter sleep
mode together.

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:08.980
Install It Into Me ♥

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:08.980
No, watch where
you save that!

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:08.980
Ababa... | The results of her studying went in a weird direction... | Sleep...

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:07.320
Looks like... 
I'm staying up all night again...

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:14.820
New Bunko Volumes

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:18.280
Your first manga series 
is selling really well, Ruki-chan.

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:20.770
We didn't have to come look...

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:25.530
Scuffling Wildly Rendezvous

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:25.530
<i>I feel like my shame is being spread across 
the world, so I'm definitely conflicted...</i>

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:27.600
<i>Well, it's not like I'm using my actual name,</i>

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:29.390
<i>so if I just think of it as someone else...</i>

00:11:29.390 --> 00:11:30.380
Oh, right.

00:11:30.380 --> 00:11:34.050
We're going to be doing a fair for our 
magazine at this bookstore next month,

00:11:34.050 --> 00:11:36.660
could we ask you to do an autograph signing?

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:40.260
Oh, my.

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:43.350
Look at you, getting so excited 
about getting to be in front of people.

00:11:43.350 --> 00:11:44.560
What am I going to do with you?

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:46.010
Huh?

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:47.490
You're doing an autograph signing, Ruki-san?

00:11:47.490 --> 00:11:49.220
That's amazing! Congrats!

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:51.090
There's nothing to celebrate!

00:11:51.090 --> 00:11:52.480
Why?

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:53.390
Because...

00:11:53.390 --> 00:11:56.560
So you're the one drawing 
this perverted manga.

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:56.110
Big Boobies ♥ Himeko-sensei
Autograph Signing

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:56.560
You're so dirty!

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:57.730
Talk about a pervert!

00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:58.800
You pervert!

00:11:58.100 --> 00:11:59.620
It's Ruki-san from Class 1.

00:11:58.800 --> 00:11:59.940
Big Boobies ♥ Himeko-sensei is the worst!

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:02.480
You've destroyed our family!

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:04.720
Please forgive me! Please forgive me!

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:06.530
<i>Her sense of guilt is way too strong.</i>

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:09.180
That's not how autograph signings go,

00:12:09.180 --> 00:12:11.460
and you have a lot of 
female readers in their twenties,

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:12.790
so it's not like your family would find out.

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:14.420
Oh, yeah!

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:16.430
Then I have nothing to worry about 
except everything!

00:12:16.430 --> 00:12:18.850
The readers are going to be so 
disappointed when they see me...

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:21.050
Huh? Why?

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:25.770
I don't see a problem...

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:25.760
Big Boobies

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:26.470
Oh.

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:28.110
Don't actually realize the problem!

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:32.020
Your editor came up with that name, right?

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:34.400
Even though that's your pen name,

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:36.200
you never actually claimed 
that you had big boobs, right?

00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:37.930
That's not all!

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:40.320
Aah!
I'm Himeko-tan and my chest is so heavy,
 my shoulders hurt so much (><)
But I'm going to do my best
to draw more pervy manga!!

00:12:37.930 --> 00:12:40.320
My author comments...

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:42.380
Yeah, that's totally your fault.

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:43.730
I was sleepy, okay?!

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:46.740
I had deadlines lined up and I 
was loopy from being so tired!

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:48.560
Um, um...

00:12:48.560 --> 00:12:52.370
I'll stuff my bra as much as I can and then 
wear a top that's loose at the top, and...

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:54.920
What should I do? 
What do you think I should do?!

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:57.470
I'm so nervous, I can't think straight!

00:12:57.470 --> 00:12:58.340
Ruki-san...

00:12:59.360 --> 00:13:02.210
When I squeeze you, my tension goes away...

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:03.140
That's it!

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:10.220
Big Boobies ♥ Himeko-sensei
Autograph Signing

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:05.610
If you say you brought your child with you,

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:07.500
they won't be able to see your chest! 
You're killing two birds with one stone!

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:08.690
I don't look that old!

00:13:08.690 --> 00:13:10.440
I don't look that young!

00:13:10.940 --> 00:13:13.410
I know! Koyume-chan, fill in for me!

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:15.420
What?! I couldn't...

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:18.420
Being your stand-in sounds 
like it'd be really hard...

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:20.320
But I guess I'll try.

00:13:20.740 --> 00:13:22.180
Thank you!

00:13:22.180 --> 00:13:24.660
Tee-hee! I'm Ruki!

00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:26.180
I wouldn't say that!

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:29.280
Sexy Ruki-chan Beam!

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:31.700
I wouldn't do any one-shot gags like that!

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:34.110
And don't use my real name!

00:13:34.110 --> 00:13:36.320
Koyume's too different from you...

00:13:36.320 --> 00:13:37.130
If you want a stand in,

00:13:37.130 --> 00:13:40.170
you'll need someone who's more 
like Ruki-san and more mature.

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:44.880
What? You have an autograph signing?

00:13:45.140 --> 00:13:46.820
Oh, that's wonderful.

00:13:46.820 --> 00:13:47.850
Congratulations.

00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:49.090
Er, um...

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:52.560
We'll have to make some 
red bean rice and celebrate.

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:55.320
I'll make some soup with clams, too.

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:58.220
I made a mistake...

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:48.650
Take that!

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:48.650
And that!

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:48.650
She moves
so fast!

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:52.240
Meteor
Strike

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:52.240
Sploosh

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:52.240
The emperor delivers
a decisive blow!

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:52.240
And no one
survives!!

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:15.100
Scuffling Wildly Rendezvous

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:15.100
Book Release Commemoration Event 
 Big Boobies♥Himeko-sensei Autograph Signing

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:22.520
Hime 
Autograph Signing

00:15:32.020 --> 00:15:34.260
What should I do, Tsu-chan?

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:36.710
I can't do an autograph signing!

00:15:36.710 --> 00:15:38.710
I'm too embarrassed!

00:15:39.640 --> 00:15:42.100
Hey, are you ignoring me?

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:44.530
<i>Come to think of it,</i>

00:15:44.530 --> 00:15:46.770
<i>Tsu-chan is hiding the 
fact that she's a girl,</i>

00:15:46.770 --> 00:15:49.440
<i>so even if she wanted to do an 
autograph signing, she couldn't.</i>

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:52.720
<i>And yet I was just thinking about myself...</i>

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:54.720
<i>I didn't even consider her feelings...</i>

00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:57.210
Tsu-chan, I'm sorry...

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:00.560
Rukki's new name ideas
The Former Big Boobies♥Himeko
No Boobies♥Himeko
Little Bust

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:00.560
That's what you were thinking about?!

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:02.560
It's so strange.

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:06.700
Just a few years ago, we were
the ones lining up for autographs.

00:16:11.230 --> 00:16:13.530
You're right.

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:15.250
Rukki...

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:20.540
I think you should remember 
how you felt back then.

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:35.300
July 29th

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:50.030
The day of the autograph signing

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:09.040
Big Boobies ♥ Himeko-sensei
First Comic Commemorative Autograph Signing

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:09.040
Scuffling Widely
Rendezvous

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:30.020
Ruki-chan, come here a sec.

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:37.700
A girl can turn into a different 
version of herself with makeup.

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:45.430
Don't move.

00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:47.540
Are you nervous?

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:51.680
You look mature, but you're still just a child.

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:54.510
<i>What is this gentle aura?</i>

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:11.980
And now, the adult Ruki-chan is complete!

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:13.730
You seem older!

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:15.040
Looks good.

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:19.330
I feel like that nervous feeling 
in my chest has calmed down.

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:20.950
Thank goodness.

00:18:21.390 --> 00:18:25.690
I love your love story, Ruki-chan.

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:28.670
It's so exciting, and a 
little bittersweet at times.

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:33.310
I'm sure the fans you'll see
feel the same way.

00:18:34.970 --> 00:18:36.670
Matron...

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:40.090
Big Boobies♥Himeko-sensei
Autograph Signing
Morning Session  11:00
Afternoon Session  14:00

00:19:06.610 --> 00:19:09.620
Everyone, thank you so much for coming today.

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:19.890
Himeko-sensei!

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:21.320
I'm so happy I get to meet you!

00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:22.600
Himeko-sama!

00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:24.720
Himeko!

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:26.910
Ruki-chan's so popular!

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:28.000
She is.

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:29.730
Looks like it's going well.

00:19:31.710 --> 00:19:33.240
<i>This is amazing...</i>

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:37.410
<i>So many people have come...</i>

00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:40.690
<i>just to see me.</i>

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:48.290
I wanted to meet you so 
badly, Himeko-oneesama!

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.080
Onee-sama?

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:50.080
My husband and I both read your work!

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:53.290
Himeko... onee-sama...

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:56.820
I'm happy to meet you, too,

00:19:56.820 --> 00:19:58.250
my sweet, little bunnies.

00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:05.370
Things aren't going well with my boyfriend.

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:09.880
How can I make things right, 
like in your manga?

00:20:09.880 --> 00:20:13.410
You can't make that face if 
you want to be the heroine.

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:16.040
Sexiness exudes from confidence.

00:20:17.140 --> 00:20:19.890
You need to love yourself more.

00:20:19.890 --> 00:20:22.250
That's the secret to
becoming a perfect woman.

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:24.110
Onee-sama...

00:20:27.400 --> 00:20:28.850
She's totally into it.

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:30.950
Not only is the power of makeup amazing,

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:33.730
the matron's encouragement 
really had an impact!

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:37.460
Big Boobies♥Himeko-sensei
Autograph Signing
Morning Session  Already Ended
Afternoon Session  14:00

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:42.400
There were people in tears because 
they got to meet you, Ruki-san!

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:44.670
And some people came from so far away!

00:20:46.400 --> 00:20:47.270
This was...

00:20:47.900 --> 00:20:51.360
the happiest day of my life.

00:20:51.910 --> 00:20:55.350
I'm so glad that I draw manga.

00:20:57.210 --> 00:20:59.410
Even on days I couldn't get 
out of bed because of a fever,

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:01.940
or the day my doggy died back at home,

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:03.650
I kept drawing pervy manga,

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:05.790
even though I was crying...

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:08.200
Yeah, you did good.

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:10.290
I...

00:21:10.670 --> 00:21:14.880
totally thought I was walking down 
the wrong path this whole time...

00:21:15.520 --> 00:21:18.660
because I ended up a completely different 
manga artist than the one I wanted to be.

00:21:20.240 --> 00:21:22.390
But I feel so much better now.

00:21:22.390 --> 00:21:27.160
I'll never be embarrassed 
about my manga ever again.

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:28.300
Yeah!

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:32.430
I think there are tons of people who'll feel 
their temperature rise reading your manga.

00:21:32.430 --> 00:21:33.440
Right?

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:36.060
When you say it like that, I guess 
I'm still a little embarrass—

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:37.380
But it's not embarrassing!

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:38.570
It's an amazing talent!

00:21:38.570 --> 00:21:39.740
I look up to you so much!

00:21:42.820 --> 00:21:44.280
Kaos-chan...

00:21:45.220 --> 00:21:46.490
Thank you.

00:21:48.610 --> 00:21:50.080
Big Boobies-sensei!

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:51.670
Big Boobies♥Himeko-sensei!

00:21:51.670 --> 00:21:53.650
We're starting the afternoon 
autograph signing now.

00:21:54.800 --> 00:21:58.820
That pen name is still embarrassing!

00:23:30.960 --> 00:23:31.820
So bright!

00:23:31.820 --> 00:23:33.180
Her body is also so bright!

00:23:33.180 --> 00:23:34.550
So bright!

00:23:34.550 --> 00:23:35.680
So bright!

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:39.930
Next Time

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:39.930
Amisawa-san, do you cosplay?

00:23:35.890 --> 00:23:39.610
Next time, "Amisawa-san, do you cosplay?"
